      propertyPath: messageArray.Array.size
      value: 8
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7786807045612242666, guid: 25562f04acd008843b8ce7a876cbafb7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'messageArray.Array.data[0]'
      value: Oh right. I forgot.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7786807045612242666, guid: 25562f04acd008843b8ce7a876cbafb7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'messageArray.Array.data[1]'
      value: You can glide, but you still can't fly...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7786807045612242666, guid: 25562f04acd008843b8ce7a876cbafb7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'messageArray.Array.data[2]'
      value: You can glide past some of the <color=#00E2FB>Thorns</color> and the
        <color=#00E2FB>Swamp Patches</color>.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7786807045612242666, guid: 25562f04acd008843b8ce7a876cbafb7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'messageArray.Array.data[3]'
      value: But sometimes you will have to find other ways to evade them.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7786807045612242666, guid: 25562f04acd008843b8ce7a876cbafb7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'messageArray.Array.data[4]'
      value: Jump past them as quickly as you can, without getting bitten too hard
        by prickles
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7786807045612242666, guid: 25562f04acd008843b8ce7a876cbafb7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'messageArray.Array.data[5]'
      value: or getting drawn too deep underground by the mud.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7786807045612242666, guid: 25562f04acd008843b8ce7a876cbafb7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'messageArray.Array.data[6]'
      value: 'You will always  be able to drag yourself out of the <color=#00E2FB>Swamp
        Patches</color> '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7786807045612242666, guid: 25562f04acd008843b8ce7a876cbafb7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'messageArray.Array.data[7]'
      value: by jumping as much as you can.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7786807045612242666, guid: 25562f04acd008843b8ce7a876cbafb7, type: 3}
