      value: 7
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7786807045612242666, guid: 25562f04acd008843b8ce7a876cbafb7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'messageArray.Array.data[0]'
      value: The <color=#00E2FB>Swamp</color> can be particularly challenging for
        someone without wings.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7786807045612242666, guid: 25562f04acd008843b8ce7a876cbafb7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'messageArray.Array.data[1]'
      value: Luckily, the <color=#00E2FB>Bird</color> offers you its <color=#00E2FB>Soul</color>.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7786807045612242666, guid: 25562f04acd008843b8ce7a876cbafb7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'messageArray.Array.data[2]'
      value: Now you will be able to <color=#00E2FB>glide</color> over some spaces
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7786807045612242666, guid: 25562f04acd008843b8ce7a876cbafb7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'messageArray.Array.data[3]'
      value: that were to wide to jump over before.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7786807045612242666, guid: 25562f04acd008843b8ce7a876cbafb7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'messageArray.Array.data[4]'
      value: '<color=yellow>While in </color><br></color><color=red>MID JUMP</color><color=yellow>,
